<title>UK: Pilot Inv forms panel after bid offer.</title>
<headline>Pilot Inv forms panel after bid offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilot Investment Trust Plc Trust said on Wednesday that it had formed a special panel of independent directors after it rejected an unsolicited offer from Undervalued Assets Trust Plc.</p>
<p>Undervalued had said last week it would offer seven new shares in its share capital in exchange for every nine Pilot shares and 33 pence for each Pilot warrant.</p>
<p>Pilot rejected the offer saying it undervalued the firm.</p>
<p>The independent directors are also appointing Merrill Lynch International to Pilot's financial adviser and broker.</p>
<p>Pilot reiterated its advice to shareholders to reject the offer until further communication from the independent directors.</p>
<p>-London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
